(7149865, 1096556, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2013-12-31 14:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149866, 1096491, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, who had time to put up that many lights?!?</td>', 'Wow, who had time to put up that many lights?!?', '2013-12-31 14:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149867, 1096597, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the old school feel this has.</td>', 'I like the old school feel this has.', '2013-12-31 14:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149897, 1096358, 173844, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on why this feels magical, but it''s just right in so many ways... braided trunk, tight crown, pleasing shadows.  The only movement is in the changing sky.  Nice balance, nice title.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on why this feels magical, but it''s just right in so many ways... braided trunk, tight crown, pleasing shadows.  The only movement is in the changing sky.  Nice balance, nice title.', '2013-12-31 15:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149899, 1096503, 173844, '<td valign="top">In an "ordinary" setting, an impressive tree.  The shadows bring a certain rhythm to the scene.</td>', 'In an "ordinary" setting, an impressive tree.  The shadows bring a certain rhythm to the scene.', '2013-12-31 16:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149900, 1096349, 114225, '<td valign="top">The chilly, invisible breeze of winter.</td>', 'The chilly, invisible breeze of winter.', '2013-12-31 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149901, 1096598, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks very mathematical.</td>', 'Wow, looks very mathematical.', '2013-12-31 16:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149902, 1096545, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of portrait orientation for this landscape.</td>', 'Great use of portrait orientation for this landscape.', '2013-12-31 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149903, 1096100, 114225, '<td valign="top">I always love good hoar frost.</td>', 'I always love good hoar frost.', '2013-12-31 16:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149904, 1096234, 114225, '<td valign="top">The person certainly adds a lot.</td>', 'The person certainly adds a lot.', '2013-12-31 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149905, 1096487, 114225, '<td valign="top">This has a certain mood to it that I enjoy.</td>', 'This has a certain mood to it that I enjoy.', '2013-12-31 16:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149906, 1096565, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of HDR.</td>', 'Excellent use of HDR.', '2013-12-31 16:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149907, 1096343, 114225, '<td valign="top">So peaceful.</td>', 'So peaceful.', '2013-12-31 16:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149908, 1096544, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s rewarding to come all the way forward from afar to finally arrive at the point of focus.  The handling is like a watercolor painting.</td>', 'It''s rewarding to come all the way forward from afar to finally arrive at the point of focus.  The handling is like a watercolor painting.', '2013-12-31 16:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149909, 1096522, 173844, '<td valign="top">The forward headstones and the ferns seem to be engaged in a chorus of auld land syne.</td>', 'The forward headstones and the ferns seem to be engaged in a chorus of auld land syne.', '2013-12-31 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149910, 1096413, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sweeping sunlight on a dry field of trees of character.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful sweeping sunlight on a dry field of trees of character.  I like this a lot.', '2013-12-31 16:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149913, 1096595, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice palette of blues.</td>', 'Nice palette of blues.', '2013-12-31 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149915, 1096359, 173844, '<td valign="top">The tree in the water seems to be some elongated animal straining to reach the other bank.  That''s the tension I feel here on this gray day.</td>', 'The tree in the water seems to be some elongated animal straining to reach the other bank.  That''s the tension I feel here on this gray day.', '2013-12-31 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149916, 1096575, 174063, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2013-12-31 16:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149917, 1096525, 173844, '<td valign="top">Along with the impressive luxuriance of the tree''s leaves, this picture is comical in an understated way ---  a brigade of wall-e-like characters ready for action.  Or garbage cans, whatever.  I like the framing that allows the foreground to continue opening outward.</td>', 'Along with the impressive luxuriance of the tree''s leaves, this picture is comical in an understated way ---  a brigade of wall-e-like characters ready for action.  Or garbage cans, whatever.  I like the framing that allows the foreground to continue opening outward.', '2013-12-31 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149918, 1096565, 173844, '<td valign="top">The serenity of this locale is beautifully captured.  Well balanced.  Is that a person in a hammock to the left of the tree base?  An alligator?</td>', 'The serenity of this locale is beautifully captured.  Well balanced.  Is that a person in a hammock to the left of the tree base?  An alligator?', '2013-12-31 16:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149921, 1096117, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good title. The tree is leaning forward (to grossly anthropomorphize) in its effort.  The entire setting is appealing, from the field of grasses to the meek wire fence to the horizon of low trees to the dark sky.  I also like the overall softness.</td>', 'Good title. The tree is leaning forward (to grossly anthropomorphize) in its effort.  The entire setting is appealing, from the field of grasses to the meek wire fence to the horizon of low trees to the dark sky.  I also like the overall softness.', '2013-12-31 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149934, 1096553, 173844, '<td valign="top">The tree and the stream continue their connection after the bank was undercut.  The bright brown leaves in the foreground nicely and subtly frame the image.</td>', 'The tree and the stream continue their connection after the bank was undercut.  The bright brown leaves in the foreground nicely and subtly frame the image.', '2013-12-31 17:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149935, 1096437, 173844, '<td valign="top">Unique way to show the passage of time.</td>', 'Unique way to show the passage of time.', '2013-12-31 17:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149937, 1096147, 173844, '<td valign="top">Really opulent.  This would work in Carmen Miranda''s living room.</td>', 'Really opulent.  This would work in Carmen Miranda''s living room.', '2013-12-31 17:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149938, 1096248, 173844, '<td valign="top">The background city lights nicely intermingle with the Christmas trees of lights.</td>', 'The background city lights nicely intermingle with the Christmas trees of lights.', '2013-12-31 17:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149939, 1096597, 173844, '<td valign="top">The leaves and sky, strongly set off from the trunks and branches, are beautifully shown.  Has the light done this or is it helped along by some wonderful post-processing?  Has the feel of a watercolor painting.  Very fine photograph.</td>', 'The leaves and sky, strongly set off from the trunks and branches, are beautifully shown.  Has the light done this or is it helped along by some wonderful post-processing?  Has the feel of a watercolor painting.  Very fine photograph.', '2013-12-31 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7149942, 1096493, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully lush.  A strolling dinosaur would seem natural here.</td>', 'Wonderfully lush.  A strolling dinosaur would seem natural here.', '2013-12-31 17:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150132, 1096343, 113156, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.', '2014-01-01 07:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
