(7150620, 1096358, 100831, '<td valign="top">that''s thoughtful... nice shadows and curves.</td>', 'that''s thoughtful... nice shadows and curves.', '2014-01-02 08:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150621, 1096562, 100831, '<td valign="top">life... beautifully rendered.</td>', 'life... beautifully rendered.', '2014-01-02 08:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150622, 1095993, 100831, '<td valign="top">ok.... back to the future.</td>', 'ok.... back to the future.', '2014-01-02 08:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150626, 1096526, 100831, '<td valign="top">cute... love how the shadows are bigger.</td>', 'cute... love how the shadows are bigger.', '2014-01-02 09:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150627, 1096596, 100831, '<td valign="top">I feel the warmth, take a deep breath... all is good.</td>', 'I feel the warmth, take a deep breath... all is good.', '2014-01-02 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150634, 1096180, 173844, '<td valign="top">Commonly used perspective heightened by the very interesting blending of clouds and whitened foliage. Dark trunks and patch of sky anchor the image.</td>', 'Commonly used perspective heightened by the very interesting blending of clouds and whitened foliage. Dark trunks and patch of sky anchor the image.', '2014-01-02 09:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150639, 1096449, 173844, '<td valign="top">Way to pile it on.  That aside, enjoyable incongruity, nice focus and comfortable balance.  I especially like the cutaway view of the soil, or wall, at the bottom.</td>', 'Way to pile it on.  That aside, enjoyable incongruity, nice focus and comfortable balance.  I especially like the cutaway view of the soil, or wall, at the bottom.', '2014-01-02 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150643, 1096554, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome tree, well-placed, softened by fog.  Very enjoyable and peaceful.  And those wonderfully caught headlights!  Incredible what a few pixels can bring.</td>', 'Handsome tree, well-placed, softened by fog.  Very enjoyable and peaceful.  And those wonderfully caught headlights!  Incredible what a few pixels can bring.', '2014-01-02 10:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150646, 1096262, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic feel, aside from the wires behind the structure.  The trees are great, as the title emphasizes, both the lines of poplars and the others deeper in.  I like the cast shadows, which lend a playful note.</td>', 'Classic feel, aside from the wires behind the structure.  The trees are great, as the title emphasizes, both the lines of poplars and the others deeper in.  I like the cast shadows, which lend a playful note.', '2014-01-02 10:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150652, 1096573, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Delicate all the way through  ---  tree, snowy foreground, distant city, sky and clouds.  <br/>On a personal note, my new year''s resolution is to be more accepting of contrails.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Delicate all the way through  ---  tree, snowy foreground, distant city, sky and clouds.  On a personal note, my new year''s resolution is to be more accepting of contrails.', '2014-01-02 10:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150663, 1096542, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this high key portrait of this expansive tree in its personal environment.  I like how the fences and road disappear beyond the slight rise, and the sign that faces away from the viewer.  Maybe it says ''NYC, 1400 miles''.</td>', 'I like this high key portrait of this expansive tree in its personal environment.  I like how the fences and road disappear beyond the slight rise, and the sign that faces away from the viewer.  Maybe it says ''NYC, 1400 miles''.', '2014-01-02 10:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150670, 1096349, 173844, '<td valign="top">The title says it all.  This moody image honors the tree in simple fashion, in keeping with its extroverted but unpretentious form.  Witness born, let''s get on with the seasons.</td>', 'The title says it all.  This moody image honors the tree in simple fashion, in keeping with its extroverted but unpretentious form.  Witness born, let''s get on with the seasons.', '2014-01-02 10:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150673, 1096491, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow, that must''ve take some effort.  Nice splashes of color in the night.</td>', 'Wow, that must''ve take some effort.  Nice splashes of color in the night.', '2014-01-02 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150674, 1096530, 173844, '<td valign="top">Happily placed, impressive Christmas tree.</td>', 'Happily placed, impressive Christmas tree.', '2014-01-02 10:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150675, 1096594, 173844, '<td valign="top">Kind of disturbing, interestingly provocative.  Is this art or desecration?</td>', 'Kind of disturbing, interestingly provocative.  Is this art or desecration?', '2014-01-02 10:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150678, 1096584, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft gold and brown tones lend a nostalgic feel to this beautiful image.  The great depth of field made my stomach drop a bit -- an unusual and enjoyable engagement.</td>', 'Lovely soft gold and brown tones lend a nostalgic feel to this beautiful image.  The great depth of field made my stomach drop a bit -- an unusual and enjoyable engagement.', '2014-01-02 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150680, 1096529, 173844, '<td valign="top">The dead brown leaves are nicely intermingled with the snowy boughs.</td>', 'The dead brown leaves are nicely intermingled with the snowy boughs.', '2014-01-02 11:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150685, 1096576, 173844, '<td valign="top">Deceptively simple image of pattern and contrast.  I like the grid-like background.</td>', 'Deceptively simple image of pattern and contrast.  I like the grid-like background.', '2014-01-02 11:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150688, 1096357, 173844, '<td valign="top">The sun''s highlighting really makes this picture.</td>', 'The sun''s highlighting really makes this picture.', '2014-01-02 11:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150711, 1096536, 173844, '<td valign="top">Agreed, though the title adds a interesting</td>', 'Agreed, though the title adds a interesting', '2014-01-02 11:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150715, 1096561, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how this palm leans into the frame... "Just popped in to say hi."</td>', 'I like how this palm leans into the frame... "Just popped in to say hi."', '2014-01-02 11:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150716, 1096534, 173844, '<td valign="top">Extremely pleasing picture.  It''s the coloration, the detail, the dappling, the recession in size of the branches, all set off by the soft sky.  My friend passed by and thought it was a map.</td>', 'Extremely pleasing picture.  It''s the coloration, the detail, the dappling, the recession in size of the branches, all set off by the soft sky.  My friend passed by and thought it was a map.', '2014-01-02 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150718, 1096354, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely tree-filled winter scene. It invites you right in.  It''s a privilege to see this through the photographer''s eyes.  A path through the central depression and now you have a story.</td>', 'Lovely tree-filled winter scene. It invites you right in.  It''s a privilege to see this through the photographer''s eyes.  A path through the central depression and now you have a story.', '2014-01-02 11:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150744, 1096492, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cheery.</td>', 'Cheery.', '2014-01-02 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150750, 1096155, 173844, '<td valign="top">The orange tint works well in this instance.  Nice crispness within the fog.  I like the fence curving along with the road.  Altogether well done.</td>', 'The orange tint works well in this instance.  Nice crispness within the fog.  I like the fence curving along with the road.  Altogether well done.', '2014-01-02 13:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150754, 1096327, 173844, '<td valign="top">The trees and building front are contesting for attention, and the sky is oddly dark.  The building itself is interesting.</td>', 'The trees and building front are contesting for attention, and the sky is oddly dark.  The building itself is interesting.', '2014-01-02 13:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150759, 1096591, 173844, '<td valign="top">Black and white seems to be a good option for snowy scenes.  This tree is well chosen for a silhouette.  What I find most interesting is this photo is the upper sky with its seeming snowfall, reminiscent of how some fireworks finish off.</td>', 'Black and white seems to be a good option for snowy scenes.  This tree is well chosen for a silhouette.  What I find most interesting is this photo is the upper sky with its seeming snowfall, reminiscent of how some fireworks finish off.', '2014-01-02 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150761, 1096527, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this image of almost Japanese simplicity, the tree toughing it out in the wind-sculpted snow.</td>', 'I like this image of almost Japanese simplicity, the tree toughing it out in the wind-sculpted snow.', '2014-01-02 13:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150770, 1096545, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very effective and fascinating long moment of the atmospheric natural forest advancing on civilization, with its controlled tree plantings.</td>', 'Very effective and fascinating long moment of the atmospheric natural forest advancing on civilization, with its controlled tree plantings.', '2014-01-02 13:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150777, 1096521, 173844, '<td valign="top">The dried leaves contrast nicely with the shimmering water and reflections.</td>', 'The dried leaves contrast nicely with the shimmering water and reflections.', '2014-01-02 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150780, 1096575, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent chiaroscuro.</td>', 'Excellent chiaroscuro.', '2014-01-02 13:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150785, 1096419, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting rays from a streetlight.  Film noirish.</td>', 'Interesting rays from a streetlight.  Film noirish.', '2014-01-02 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150792, 1096598, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even after looking up the title word in the dictionary, I don''t understand, but maybe that''s on me.  The tree patterns, though, are artfully presented.</td>', 'Even after looking up the title word in the dictionary, I don''t understand, but maybe that''s on me.  The tree patterns, though, are artfully presented.', '2014-01-02 13:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150795, 1096234, 173844, '<td valign="top">Has a Russian feel to it, but that''s neither here nor there.  Effectively conveys the human scale.</td>', 'Has a Russian feel to it, but that''s neither here nor there.  Effectively conveys the human scale.', '2014-01-02 14:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150796, 1096170, 173844, '<td valign="top">Trees as brought out by the sun.  Nice casual feel.</td>', 'Trees as brought out by the sun.  Nice casual feel.', '2014-01-02 14:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150802, 1096596, 173844, '<td valign="top">I really like this spooky, to me, image.  Despite the partial sun-drenching, what''s ambiguous and indistinct still inspires fear.  It took awhile to discern that the object in an aura to the right of the tree is a person (if it in fact is).  The tonal gradations and atmosphere are masterfully conveyed.</td>', 'I really like this spooky, to me, image.  Despite the partial sun-drenching, what''s ambiguous and indistinct still inspires fear.  It took awhile to discern that the object in an aura to the right of the tree is a person (if it in fact is).  The tonal gradations and atmosphere are masterfully conveyed.', '2014-01-02 14:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150808, 1096566, 173844, '<td valign="top">This very minute.  Pay attention.  Nice alpenglow and delicate clouds.</td>', 'This very minute.  Pay attention.  Nice alpenglow and delicate clouds.', '2014-01-02 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150813, 1096245, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-balanced pattern study.</td>', 'Well-balanced pattern study.', '2014-01-02 14:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150823, 1096167, 173844, '<td valign="top">At first this image appeared to be a fanciful abstract.  Then it resolved into a well-titled photograph of pine(?) limbs with snow or some other treatment.  Clever and satisfying.</td>', 'At first this image appeared to be a fanciful abstract.  Then it resolved into a well-titled photograph of pine(?) limbs with snow or some other treatment.  Clever and satisfying.', '2014-01-02 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150825, 1096341, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pleasant photo of a truncated tree.</td>', 'Pleasant photo of a truncated tree.', '2014-01-02 14:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150826, 1096224, 173844, '<td valign="top">Belly up.</td>', 'Belly up.', '2014-01-02 14:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150828, 1096487, 173844, '<td valign="top">A delicate, lithograph-like photo.  Personal favorite.</td>', 'A delicate, lithograph-like photo.  Personal favorite.', '2014-01-02 14:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150830, 1096574, 173844, '<td valign="top">It looks like the birds on the right are breaking for recess.  This doesn''t subtract from, but adds to, the silhouetted trees.  The upper branches nicely frame the sun.</td>', 'It looks like the birds on the right are breaking for recess.  This doesn''t subtract from, but adds to, the silhouetted trees.  The upper branches nicely frame the sun.', '2014-01-02 14:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150834, 1096564, 173844, '<td valign="top">Can''t explain why, but I''m transfixed by the rhythm of the tree rings.  Just another way trees charm us. I like the way the cow(?) seems to slip between two of them.</td>', 'Can''t explain why, but I''m transfixed by the rhythm of the tree rings.  Just another way trees charm us. I like the way the cow(?) seems to slip between two of them.', '2014-01-02 14:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150835, 1096562, 173844, '<td valign="top">This photo has a wonderfully rewarding depth of field.</td>', 'This photo has a wonderfully rewarding depth of field.', '2014-01-02 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150836, 1096283, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, pleasant pastoral scene.</td>', 'Nice perspective, pleasant pastoral scene.', '2014-01-02 14:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150837, 1096307, 173844, '<td valign="top">Both the tree and the bird.  And what a realm!</td>', 'Both the tree and the bird.  And what a realm!', '2014-01-02 14:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150838, 1096502, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2014-01-02 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150839, 1096176, 173844, '<td valign="top">I feel it.  I''d like to know what it''s struggling with or against.</td>', 'I feel it.  I''d like to know what it''s struggling with or against.', '2014-01-02 14:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150843, 1096516, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stoic in a stark landscape.</td>', 'Stoic in a stark landscape.', '2014-01-02 15:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150844, 1096470, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pretty against the blue sky.</td>', 'Very pretty against the blue sky.', '2014-01-02 15:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150845, 1096519, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good use of ''empty'' space.  I like the staccato foreground.</td>', 'Good use of ''empty'' space.  I like the staccato foreground.', '2014-01-02 15:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150846, 1096563, 173844, '<td valign="top">Grudgingly passing through the sunlight, this tree ''chooses'' to remain in shadow.</td>', 'Grudgingly passing through the sunlight, this tree ''chooses'' to remain in shadow.', '2014-01-02 15:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150847, 1096556, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quite verdant.  I like how the trees seem to be the legs and hooves of giant animals, say, giraffes.</td>', 'Quite verdant.  I like how the trees seem to be the legs and hooves of giant animals, say, giraffes.', '2014-01-02 15:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150848, 1096104, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seems to say, "now we''re getting somewhere."</td>', 'Seems to say, "now we''re getting somewhere."', '2014-01-02 15:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150850, 1096524, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how the tint of the sky gives life to it.</td>', 'I like how the tint of the sky gives life to it.', '2014-01-02 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7150851, 1096215, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bizarro world.  Nice greens.  I especially like the wires in the sky.</td>', 'Bizarro world.  Nice greens.  I especially like the wires in the sky.', '2014-01-02 15:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
